        "Description": "Hello 47, Welcome to Miami. You&apos;re here for Grand Prix race and we need you to do several tasks for us in Miami. As we know we will also need from You to get 50,000 Emirates Skywards Miles and 7,500 Miles &amp; More Points for 7 Days. First, We need you to get tickets from Lavton Caine for Sprint and Marcus Lindsday for Grand Prix. After you&apos;re finished, You&apos;ll get 10,000 Emirates Skywards Miles and 500 Miles &amp; More points to your account. Good Luck 47!",
